Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:43.91,TL,,0,0,110,,{\an2}这一次 斯维托丽娜怎样翻回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:50.74,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Some ornamental, some pretty straightforward.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有些处理很花哨 有些则干净利落
