Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:36.09,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the opening set goes to Karolina Muchova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘由卡罗琳娜 穆霍娃拿下
