Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:05.12,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, she had to dig deep.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她必须拼尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:09.28,TL,,0,0,380,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not only was she hampered by injury, but she did not play well at the beginning.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她带着伤病 开局也发挥不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.60,TL,,0,0,500,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But boy, did she turn it around in her favor,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她终于扭转了局面
